  "releaseNotes": "# Changes since version 9.0.0:\n\n## Fixed\n- Fixed an issue where calling StartDoc() reset the GcPdfDocument.Lang property to null, causing loss of the document language setting. (DOC-7263)\n- Fixed an issue where loading and saving certain malformed PDFs could cause some pages to become blank in the saved PDF. (DOC-7275)",
